#memory box

~ block_talk_no_aida
Player: (Umm.. I think I should talk to the Nurse before I talk to anyone else.)
=> END

~ block_talk_no_memory_box
Player: (I don't think I need to talk to them right now.)
Player: (The Nurse told me to 'use' the memory box. Better do that first.)
=> END

~ block_memory_box_no_aida
Player: (I should probably talk to the nurse before I touch this weird machine.)
=> END

~ memory_box_unlocked
You slide the TechPass into the card slot.

Memory Box: Please place the headset on.

You pick up the strange device and place it over your head.

Player: (Alright... here goes.)
Player: (If this thing works...)
Player: (I might finally remember who I am.)

=> END
~ memory_box_locked
Player: (Hmmm. The screen says I need to insert my TechPass™ to begin.)

if Flags.get_level_flag("learned_techpass_from_aida") == true and Flags.get_level_flag("learned_techpass_from_sergey") == true
	Player: (This must be the card the Nurse and Sergey were talking about.)
elif Flags.get_level_flag("learned_techpass_from_aida") == true
	Player: (This must be the card the Nurse mentioned.)
elif Flags.get_level_flag("learned_techpass_from_sergey") == true
	Player: (This must be the card Sergey was talking about.)
else
	Player: (Fuck is that, now?)

do Flags.set_level_flag("has_tried_memory_box", true)
=> END

#mcbucket

~ mcbucket_sleeping_talk_to_response
Player: (The old man seems to be out cold right now.)
Player: (Wonder how long it'll last.)
=> END

~ mcbucket_med_given_after_zanopram
Hmmm. The Old Man seems unaffected. His sleep is deep.
=> END

~ toilet_flush_weak

You flush the toilet. It seems to have a weak flow.
Player: (This could probably get clogged easily...)
=> END

~ medicine_cabinet_interrupt

aiDA: Hey patient #122, that cabinet is reserved for clinical staff.
aiDA: If you are experiencing discomfort, I can assist with approved medication.
Player: (Huh. Looks like I can’t open the medicine cabinet while she’s still around.)
if Flags.get_level_flag("mcbucket_interruption_happened") or (Flags.get_level_flag("mcbucket_has_screamed_at_player") and Flags.get_level_flag("learned_about_meds_from_aida"))
	Player: (Is there any way I can send her to the other room?)
do Flags.set_level_flag("aida_stopped_cabinet", true)
=> END

~ mcbucket_not_put_to_sleep
Player: (The Old Man still seems to be up.)
Player: (I better take care of him before returning to Sergey.)
=> END

~ give_empty_inventory
Player: (I don't have anything on me to give.)
=> END

~ give_no_item_selected
Player: (I should probably figure out what I want to give them first.)
=> END